;
; How Wellspring files a log entry in MYRA: its day (days since 1970), its
; kind (wellspring_model.h WELLSPRING_ACTIVITY .. WELLSPRING_PULSE) and its
; amount in the kind's unit (minutes, ml or beats a minute).
^ZXWELL(day:i6, kind:i1) = amount:i9!
